{
  "name": "夜幕珍珠 Nightfall Pearl",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/commodities/gems/pearl-purple-dark.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">这个触感寒冷，直径</span><span class=\"1\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">寸的深黑色球体可以召来夜晚。</span><br style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">你可以花费</span><span class=\"1\">10</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">分钟激活它，一旦被激活，则周围半径十里的区域都将被夜幕笼罩，不论将其激活的时间点是白昼还是黑夜。黑夜将持续</span><span class=\"1\">24</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">小时，直到你与珍珠失去同调，或你使用一个动作终止此魔法效应。夜幕珍珠一旦被使用，则在接下来的</span><span class=\"1\">24</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">小时中无法被再次激活。</span><br style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"></p></div>",
